      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1.user can see all the product\n2.USer can add any product into the carte \n3.A user can have one cart at any moment  of time\n4.Adding the same product into the cart increase the quanity\n    instant of adding another product\n5.Size(xs,s,m,l,XL,XXl)\n6. if Any size is currently out of stock show that unavailable\n7.seller can unlist any product\n8.seller can list all the products on the dashboard\n9. In cart store  the Reference  of the product with size and quantiry.Not  the entercopy of the product\n10.user-->sellerApi- return 403\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1.user can see all the product\n2.USer can add any product into the carte \n3.A user can have one cart at any moment  of time\n4.Adding the same product into the cart increase the quanity\n    instant of adding another product\n5.Size(xs,s,m,l,XL,XXl)\n6. if Any size is currently out of stock show that unavailable\n7.seller can unlist any product\n8.seller can list all the products on the dashboard\n9. In cart store  the Reference  of the product with size and quantiry.Not  the entercopy of the product\n10.user-->sellerApi- return 403\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
